- Migration 0034: evaluation_versions, audit_answers, evaluation_actions, attachment_readings, audit_runs (immutable triggers)
- Evaluator prompt bound verbatim; 9 strict server tools; validated AI versions with deterministic CRS/coverage kept
- Page-level attachment reading with unreadable_pages, injection redaction and cache
- Seven wired buttons with action states; CV generated only on approval
- Atomic duplicate-task guard (409 DUPLICATE_TASK with taskId); unassigned filter and inline assignment; live priorities
- Desk links: prefetch disabled (framework prefetch error); evaluations section opts into tw-scope styling
- Tests: integration 9/9, Chromium E2E of all buttons, opt-in live run

